WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:40.290
Seaborg is the last one standing!

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:44.620
Which means that the Russian Team wins the first match!

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:46.370
I lost, huh?

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.820
But I have no regrets.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:52.800
As of today, I am no longer his tool.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.550
Nice battle.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.340
Dranzer was glowing.

00:01:56.340 --> 00:02:00.260
That's the light of the power that's
born from believing in your friends.

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.940
You're stronger than you've ever been, Kai.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:11.990
Kai, your feelings are in our hands. We'll turn those
feelings into power and become even stronger!

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:19.520
Curse you, Kai...

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:21.840
So, what do you think?

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:26.320
We have won the first match,

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:28.690
and obtained another Sacred Beast.

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.470
And yet you're in a bad mood?

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:31.890
You're too light!

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:38.180
In tomorrow's second match, you must
show them how fearsome Borg can truly be!

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:39.410
In that case,

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.950
we will have Boris Kuznetsov play in the second match.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:51.040
The cruelest, most heartless member of Borg.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:55.160
I'm sure he'll live up to your expectations tomorrow.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:58.000
Tear those fools apart, beyond recognition.

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:02.130
Make them feel fear, pain, and despair!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.680
Most importantly, take their Sacred Beasts!

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:06.680
Understood.

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:11.690
Byakko's Cry

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:23.440
Ladies and gentlemen! It's the second day
of the World Championship Finals!

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:27.930
Will Russia end things quickly as they did yesterday?

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.670
Or will the BBA Team
show some grit?

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:33.350
A fated battle is about to begin!

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:36.740
The two fighting in the second match will be...

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:39.530
First up is the BBA Team's own Rei!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:42.410
Rei!

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:48.200
This is our power. Ya better not lose!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:49.730
Please do your best!

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:50.850
<i>Good luck.</i>

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:52.060
Leave it to me.

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:56.640
We're counting on you, Rei.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:01.880
And from the Russian Team,

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.570
the man that's been dubbed their secret weapon...

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.680
Boris Kuznetsov!

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.440
Go for it, Rei!

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:11.910
We'll be rooting for you!

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:16.570
Show us the power of a White Tiger Clan
member that has traveled the world!

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:22.550
It finally begins...

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:27.450
Yes. Following Kai's surprise loss, Takao and
his friends have their backs up against the wall.

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:29.680
It's all up to you, Rei.

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:34.230
The BBA Team cannot afford to lose.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:40.430
Allow me to introduce a stage fit for our second match!

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:43.560
The Stadium they'll be fighting in today will be...

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:49.810
Look at that!

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.820
Is this any ordinary Beystadium?

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.900
No, no, no!

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:56.120
It's a Stadium like no other!

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.720
Ready? Go Shoot!

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:17.960
As you can see,

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:21.360
this Stadium spins quickly,
chipping away at your Bey's balance.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:22.830
This may cost you the match.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:26.780
Take things too slowly, and you might
get taken out by the Stadium itself!

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:30.470
It's an extreme Stadium that encourages aggressive play!

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:33.240
Its name is the Ultimate Stadium!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:36.720
Yes.

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:39.460
That Stadium shall be your grave!

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:42.440
The Stadium doesn't change a thing.

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:44.210
Or who my opponent is.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:45.870
I will definitely win!

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:47.920
Now, let's get started!

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:51.000
Ready? World Championship Finals, Second Match!

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.800
First Battle! Ready?

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:55.790
Three! Two! One!

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.740
Go Shoot!

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:58.800
Go, Falborg!

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:01.390
Uh-oh! Did Boris miss his shot?

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.800
Where's he aiming..?

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:07.540
Rei!

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:08.480
Rei-nii!

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:11.540
Uh-oh! We've got trouble right out of the gate!

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:14.290
A stray piece of the fence has struck Rei!

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.350
Not quite.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:17.600
That was no accident.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:18.960
He aimed at him on purpose.

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:20.050
No way!

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:22.640
Both the power and angle required to break it,

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:25.870
plus the path of the fragment offset by the stadium's spin...

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:29.470
Boris instantly calculated them all,

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:31.050
purposefully aiming for Rei!

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:34.930
He's a heartless battle machine!

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:35.950
Oh no!

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.460
Darn!

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:39.560
That Boris...

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.660
He's already set his cruelty loose.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:46.220
However... the worst has yet to come!

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:48.190
I see.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.800
He'll do anything for a win.

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:54.000
That was but a greeting.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:54.760
What?!

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.970
Before I take your Sacred Beast,

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.820
I'll make you taste fear and pain
until you beg for mercy.

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:05.200
While Rei can't stand back up
after the beating he just took,

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:06.880
Falborg won't stay off him!

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:08.410
Driger!

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.460
Keep it together, Rei! Fight back!

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:13.320
He can't! Take a look!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:16.300
Under such an overwhelming assault,

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.350
he's not in any position to counter-attack!

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:20.280
It's even worse than I thought.

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:21.940
He just doesn't match up to him.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:24.350
It's like a child going up against an adult!

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:26.300
Is this it, then?

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:28.880
This is just too unfair!

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:31.600
Driger can't keep up
with Falborg's assault!

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:34.280
Is Rei going to lose the first match?

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:37.300
Hang in there! Hang in there, Driger!

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:38.780
That won't be necessary.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:39.950
What?!

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:41.490
Falborg!

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:50.100
Rei!

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:50.110
Rei-nii!
Rei!

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.170
Rei-nii!

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:53.750
Unbelievable.

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:55.830
Driger is out!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.620
Boris is the winner!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:01.300
Rei has been blown back!

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:04.010
- Rei!
- Rei!!

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:06.470
Hang in there, Rei!

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:07.300
Are you okay?

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.080
Don't die on me now.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:14.160
After all, I'm the one who decides

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:15.560
when your time must come.

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:26.380
For an experienced Blader like Rei
to be overwhelmed in such a fashion...

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:28.540
Are you okay, Rei?

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.760
Don't worry.

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:31.070
I can still fight.

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.570
No, I would advise against it.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:37.570
You've taken considerable damage from that last battle.

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:41.080
I fear you wouldn't make it through the second round.

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:42.800
No way!

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.000
Rei...

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:47.180
Professor. How are Driger's repairs coming?

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:49.370
It's done.

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:51.690
While it took quite a bit of damage,

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:54.770
Kai offered some of his Dranzer's parts, so...

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:56.940
Regardless...

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.980
Sorry. I owe you one.

00:08:59.340 --> 00:09:01.040
One piece of advice.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:04.000
The reason Boris didn't finish you off

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.620
was to inflict more pain on you this time around.

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:10.090
When you say he didn't finish him off,

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:12.040
do you mean Boris was holding back?!

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:14.220
I know.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:15.760
What's your move, Rei?

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:19.720
If you were in my shoes, what would you do?

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:30.110
Boris has taken the lead for the Russian Team

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:31.530
with his amazing power!

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:35.520
Will Boris keep it up and take the win?

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:37.970
Or will Rei make a comeback?

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:40.730
Their destined second match is about to begin!

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:43.530
We're rooting for you, Rei!

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:44.930
Rei...

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:47.810
You must really have guts to be asking for more.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:48.440
What?!

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:51.810
And that's because you've yet
to see the <i>true</i> meaning of fear.

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:54.240
You don't know <b><i>true</i> pain!</b>

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:56.330
So, allow me to demonstrate.

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:57.460
Players!

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.280
Ready?

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:01.240
Second battle! Ready?

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:03.870
Three! Two! One!

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.530
Go Shoot!

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:10.680
This time, they're staring each other down.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:13.060
Who's going to make the first move?

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:16.310
Go! Driger!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.440
Falborg!

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:32.260
An artificial Sacred Beast!

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:33.900
Stroblitz!

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:37.820
Rei!

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:46.050
And what's that? Rei's acting a little strange!

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:04.680
This is absolutely one-sided!

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:07.930
Driger can't keep up with Falborg's assault!

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:11.230
Even so, what's going on with Rei?

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.460
What the heck?

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:15.750
What's happening to Rei?

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:17.460
It's a razor wind!

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:18.450
Razor wind?

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:22.420
It's a dangerous attack of nature
that shapes the air into sharp blades!

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:25.580
Falborg is whipping them up!

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.950
He can use the air as a blade?

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:32.380
Boris' special move targets both the Bey and the Blader.

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:33.680
It's a murderous attack!

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:35.840
What a cruel attack...

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:38.600
Borg is showing their true colors...

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:42.110
How could he damage another Blader?

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:43.560
Someone stop him!

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:47.430
So long as it's not visible to the eye,
there'll be no evidence of foul play.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.980
How cowardly!

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:50.350
This is horrible.

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.740
Does it hurt?

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:59.740
What you're feeling right now

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.850
is actual pain.

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:04.480
As a result, you're in real fear!

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:12.400
No one can stop Boris now.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:15.030
This is no longer a match.

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:16.570
It's an execution.

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:18.250
A public execution!

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:21.420
What can we do?

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.020
If this keeps up, Rei will...

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:26.070
Rei-nii... Rei-nii is going to die!

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:29.690
I guess the BBA's fate is sealed.

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.760
I can't stand for this!
We have to save Rei!

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:33.400
Don't stop me!

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:38.280
I know I've never met a Blader like you.

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:41.450
That's why I mustn't lose!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:45.670
Moreover, it's because I'm fighting after Kai!

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:48.120
I'm fighting before Takao!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.330
That's why...

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:50.460
That's why..!

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:55.590
He's just preparing himself for another beating...

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:57.180
No, not quite.

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:58.610
Rei-kun...

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:00.010
Look at those eyes!

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:06.050
Does it hurt? Are you in pain?

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:08.000
Don't be shy.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:10.330
Hurry up and die already!

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.800
How stubborn.

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:16.610
Looks like you haven't had enough.

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:18.900
Fine.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.200
I'll send you to your grave.

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:23.080
Finish him off, Falborg!

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:26.420
I've got one more trick up my sleeve!

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:29.950
Get in a hurry to win, and
you're bound to make a mistake!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.740
Tiger Fang!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.270
What?!

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:40.790
Rei!

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:41.850
Rei-nii!

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:52.000
Falborg is out!

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:53.770
Rei is the winner!

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:57.920
S-Somehow, Rei has completely turned this around!

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:00.680
I get it!

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:03.700
The one moment where there's
an opening in his final attack.

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.410
That's what Rei was waiting for!

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:08.760
That's why he withstood all
of those brutal razor-wind attacks!

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:11.580
He took all of that damage for the greater good.

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:16.420
That's something only Rei could do,
what with his knowledge of the world.

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:18.800
He's incredible.

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.010
Don't underestimate me.

00:14:23.860 --> 00:14:26.080
You're awful resilient.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:26.600
What?

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:31.630
You used up the last of your strength taking me out.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.170
Forget battling—

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:36.070
you can't even get back up!

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:37.100
It's over.

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:38.480
That's...

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:41.100
Non... sense...

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:43.530
Rei!

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.380
Rei!

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.680
You'd have put your life in danger if you kept on.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:55.460
Rei-kun...

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.570
You did very well.

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:59.220
As for the rest of you...

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:02.340
I will make a decision as the head of the BBA.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:08.540
We, the BBA Team, will forfeit
the third set of the second match.

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:12.630
No way! How can we, having come so far?

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:15.720
And Rei... what about Rei?

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:19.330
Rei fought so hard to get us here!

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:20.910
Which is why...

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:24.490
He made this decision because of Rei.

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:26.310
Don't think of it as a waste, Takao.

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:28.210
I hate it, too.

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:31.220
And hate it as I may, we must face reality.

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:34.660
It's truly a shame that we could not stop Borg.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:37.930
But Rei-kun's life comes first.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:39.300
R-Rei?

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:40.570
Rei!

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:43.600
Don't get up!

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:44.980
It's over, Rei...

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.800
It's all over!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:49.370
You don't have to fight any more!

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:51.540
Rei..!

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:54.790
Why? What's gotten into you?

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:55.980
Hey, Rei!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.310
Give it up.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:00.440
Rei's standing out of pure instinct.

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:01.670
He wants to fight.

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:04.550
His instincts are telling him that he wants to win.

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:06.020
Rei...

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:08.390
Kai...

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:12.460
Put an end to this.

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:31.380
We kick off the third set with both sides even, 1-to-1!

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.640
It has to go one way or the other!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.090
You don't know when to quit.

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:38.030
Are you in such a hurry to die?

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:41.220
I'll take your life, and your Sacred Beast!

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:55.100
Don't do it! It'd be dangerous to continue!

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:57.600
Stop! Stop that, Rei!

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:59.140
You've done enough!

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:00.300
You did well, Rei!

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:01.880
Rei...

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:04.550
Rei-nii...

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:07.110
I'm begging you, please...

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:08.220
You're going to die!

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:09.320
I understand...

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:11.560
I understand how you feel!

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:12.370
Which is why...

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:15.200
you have to let it end, Rei!

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:17.440
Don't make me lose you!

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:21.710
Why?

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:27.160
Why can he keep fighting?

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:30.040
He shouldn't even be standing...

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:36.580
Then die!

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:50.370
Where am I?

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:53.910
What am I doing?

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:56.120
Lai...

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:57.710
Mao...

00:17:57.710 --> 00:17:58.740
My friends...

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:01.780
Those times...

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:03.600
were fun.

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:04.820
Takao?

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:06.150
My team...

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:09.360
What are you all doing?

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.330
What a happy bunch.

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:12.200
Right, Kai?

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:13.700
Kai...

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:16.890
Takao...

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:20.290
Byakko...

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:21.740
Byakko!

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:24.000
What?!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:26.710
Byakko!!

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:30.620
What's that?

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:33.940
Byakko's glowing the same
way Seiryuu and Suzaku did...

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:35.680
No, it's brighter.

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:37.390
Byakko is...

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:39.360
Byakko is holding Rei...

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:40.810
W-What is this?!

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.040
You will not get your hands...

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.940
on Byakko, nor on my life!

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:50.650
This is it!

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:52.950
Tiger Fang!

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:06.480
W-What is this?

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:11.080
What just happened?

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:17.030
F-Falborg is destroyed!

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:18.100
What about Driger?

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.440
Still spinning!

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:23.030
Driger is still up!

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:24.200
Rei wins!

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:27.500
The World Championship's Second Match

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.490
goes to the BBA!

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:33.190
We did it!

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:33.960
We made it!

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:37.660
Well done. You did it for us, Rei.

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:39.660
C-Curses...

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:42.190
Congratulations, Rei-nii!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.040
Rei-nii..?

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:45.810
Rei?

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:49.990
Rei?

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.060
Rei-nii?

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:54.370
Rei...

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:56.320
Rei...

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:01.180
R-Rei!!!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.020
Rei...

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:09.240
Rei-nii!

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:12.650
It's all over, Rei.

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:13.820
Rei-nii...

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:18.750
Takao...

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:21.280
Did we...

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.280
Win?

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:25.380
Yeah. We did.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:28.740
You won the Second Match.

00:20:29.190 --> 00:20:30.840
In its final moments,

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:37.050
Byakko merged its remaining energy into Driger
and disappeared, in its struggle against Falborg.

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:40.720
He'll be back.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:44.960
Byakko will return to me.

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:46.560
You're right.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:49.660
You're the pride of the White Tiger Clan, Rei.

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:51.600
I know Byakko will...

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:53.750
return to you!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.370
Take care of him.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:56.020
Rei-nii...

00:20:58.400 --> 00:20:59.280
Rei.

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:02.880
What's the matter, Rei?

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:05.170
I pass the baton.

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:06.710
Yeah.

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:09.130
It's in my hands now.

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:18.240
It's all...

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:20.630
in my hands now!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:58.530 --> 00:23:01.800
According to my calculations, the climax,

00:23:01.800 --> 00:23:03.980
the match between Takao and Yuriy, has come!

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:08.460
In preparation for that battle, with the PPB's technology and our friendship,

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:11.120
We conduct a plan to power up Takao!

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:13.500
What's this? His opponent, Yuriy,

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:16.550
seems to have gone under some terrifying modifications!

00:23:17.020 --> 00:23:19.130
His Sacred Beast is an ice wolf!

00:23:19.550 --> 00:23:22.050
Next time: Apocalypse in the Snow Field!

00:23:22.050 --> 00:23:24.050
I'm scared stiff!
